  "name": "Korean Pokémon: Mega Voltage launch promo card pack",
  "category": "campaign",
  "description": {
    "text": "A campaign marking the launch of the anime series Pokémon: Mega Voltage on Jaeneung TV, run at Pokémon Card Shops from 15 November to 14 December 2025. Showing a photo of the show on screen got one free promo card pack a day, and each 10,000 won spent on Pokémon cards got another; each pack held one random card of five, 010/M-P Meowscarada to 014/M-P Terapagos ex, all marked with the show's logo."
  },
